BUGS
     _L_s_e_e_k is a no-op on character special files.  No bounds
     check is made on _o_f_f_s_e_t.  It is permissible to seek past the
     end of a file open only for reading.

ASSEMBLER
     (lseek = 19.)
     (file descriptor in r0)
     sys lseek; offset1; offset2; whence

     _O_f_f_s_e_t_1 and _o_f_f_s_e_t_2 are the high and low words of _o_f_f_s_e_t; r0
     and r1 contain the pointer upon return.

